# Database `pnpm test:e2e` writes to — never the same one `pnpm dev` uses.
#
# The CRUD specs create and delete real rows (docs/TESTING.md's own warning).
# playwright.config.ts loads this file directly and refuses to start if this
# DATABASE_URL matches .env's (TD-65). Point it at a second database inside
# the same Postgres container — same credentials as .env, different name:
#
#   docker exec -it my-database-container \
#     psql -U admin -d campaign_settings -c 'CREATE DATABASE campaign_settings_e2e;'
#   DATABASE_URL="postgresql://admin:change_me@localhost:5432/campaign_settings_e2e" \
#     pnpm prisma migrate deploy
#
# Not `db push` — it only diffs the schema shape and never runs migration
# files, so the faction table (seeded by a raw-SQL INSERT in the
# add_faction_table_and_fk migration) stays empty and pnpm db:seed fails
# on npc's foreign key to it (TD-73).
#
# See docs/TESTING.md §E2E for the full setup.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://admin:change_me@localhost:5432/campaign_settings_e2e"
